# ====================
# Reproducibility exception: commit the small phylogenetic-analysis inputs and
# results so the null model, taxon-level K, and figures reproduce from a clone
# without the 214 MB workspace or 26 MB scoring file. These negations are last so
# they override the broad data/ and *.rds/*.csv ignores above; each "dir + dir/*"
# pair satisfies git's rule that a file cannot be re-included while its parent
# directory is excluded.
# ====================
!data/clean/
data/clean/*
!data/clean/phylo_inputs_slim.rds
!data/summary/
data/summary/*
!data/summary/predictor_effects.rds
!data/summary/phylo_analysis_results.rds
!data/summary/phylo_contribution_null_ses.csv
!data/summary/phylo_score_contribution_null_ses.csv
